OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FTomorrow, winds will
OL,6,Fstrengthen again for a breezy day.
OL,7,FThere is even a risk of coastal gales
OL,8,Fin the northwest later. Sunny spells
OL,9,Fto start, becoming cloudy. Another
OL,10,Fmild day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FIncreasingly cloudy on Thursday with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of heavy rain and strong
OL,15,Fwinds. Dry with sunny spells on Friday
OL,16,Fbut remaining breezy. Cooler on
OL,17,FSaturday with light winds and sunny
OL,18,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
